            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kandi nimusarura ibisarurwa byo mu gihugu cyanyu, ntimuzasarure inkokora z'imirima yanyu zose, ntimuzatoragure ibisigaye guhumbwa, ahubwo mubisigire umukene n'umusuhuke w'umunyamahanga. Ndi Uwiteka Imana yanyu.”",
