            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iyo ni yo minsi mikuru y'Uwiteka mukwiriye kuranga ko ari iyo guterana kwera, ngo mujye muyitambiraho Uwiteka ibitambo bikongorwa n'umuriro, igitambo cyoswa n'ituro ry'ifu, n'igitambo kindi n'amaturo y'ibyokunywa, n'ituro ryose n'igitambo cyose ku munsi wacyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibyo ntibibakureho kuziririza amasabato y'Uwiteka no gutura amaturo yanyu, ayo muhiguza imihigo yose, n'ayo muturishwa Uwiteka yose n'imitima ikunze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ariko muhereye kuri uwo munsi wa cumi n'itanu w'ukwezi kwa karindwi, mumaze gusarura imyaka yo mu gihugu cyanyu, mujye muziririza iminsi mikuru irindwi y'Uwiteka, uyitangira ube uwo kuruhuka, n'uwa munani ube uwo kuruhuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku munsi uyitangira mujye mwenda imbuto z'ibiti byiza n'amashami y'imikindo, n'amashami y'ibiti bisagambye binini, n'ingemwe z'imikinga yo ku migezi, mumare iminsi irindwi munezererwe imbere y'Uwiteka Imana yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko umwaka utashye mujye muziriririza Uwiteka mutyo iminsi mikuru irindwi. Iryo ribabere itegeko ridakuka mu bihe byanyu byose, mujye muziririza iyo minsi mikuru mu kwezi kwa karindwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mujye mumara iminsi irindwi muri mu ngando, Abisirayeli ba kavukire bose babe mu ngando, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngo ab'ibihe byanyu byose bamenye yuko nabesheje Abisirayeli mu ngando ubwo nabakuraga mu gihugu cya Egiputa. Ndi Uwiteka Imana yanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
